Title:  What are we here for if not to

Seq:    12.6.109.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Miller, Henry|Henry Miller]], 1918, from the remarks "[[Memo to Self]]"

Timestamp: 20251019194318

Date Added: 2025-10-19 13:43:18 -0600

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: We think and care big picture and long-term

Body:

What are we here for if not to enjoy life eternal, solve what problems we can, give light, peace and joy to our fellow-man, and leave this dear fucked-up planet a little healthier than when we were born?

